WEBVTT

00:16:59.314 --> 00:17:01.771
e olhar em volta, uns para os outros

00:17:02.295 --> 00:17:05.466
fitar a vastidão,

00:17:05.961 --> 00:17:07.333
a complexidade,

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.209
e o mistério do universo

00:17:11.085 --> 00:17:12.914
e ser capaz de dizer:

00:17:13.933 --> 00:17:15.285
"Uau,

00:17:15.923 --> 00:17:17.285
"Não sei.

00:17:18.123 --> 00:17:20.000
"Talvez esteja errada."

00:17:20.647 --> 00:17:21.914
Obrigada.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:25.171
(Aplausos)

00:17:26.114 --> 00:17:27.323
Obrigada a todos.

00:17:27.323 --> 00:17:30.428
(Aplausos)